Data license for derived result tables
=======================================

This license applies ONLY to the derived data files in this repository — namely
`results/*.json` and `analysis/classifier_features_pooled.csv`. It does NOT apply
to the source code, which is under the MIT License (see `LICENSE`).

These files contain derived statistics (rates, counts, per-component radiomic
features, operating-point thresholds) and public KiTS23 case identifiers only.
They contain no voxel arrays, no segmentation masks, and no image content.

